rror": false}, {"t_ms": 5983564, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RknfHovuM1mYvmS3K58BHo", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 5983864, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RknfHovuM1mYvmS3K58BHo", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 5983864, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RknfHovuM1mYvmS3K58BHo", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 5986852, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01AgQ3QwBnMLroZE4EF4KWAJ", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` is documented as banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but the implementation used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This caused `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build.\n\nThis PR changes the rounding mode in `src/money.py` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. No other behavior changes.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- Test expectations checked by hand: 2.675 -> 2.68 and 2.665 -> 2.66 under half-even.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 5987752, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01AgQ3QwBnMLroZE4EF4KWAJ", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-half-even-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 5987752, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AgQ3QwBnMLroZE4EF4KWAJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 5989403, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The nightly failure is fixed and PR #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **Root cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` had a docstring saying banker's rounding, but the code used `ROUND_HALF_UP`.\n- **Fix:** Changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding` (commit `08d3cd5986`). Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101, reviewer alex.\n\nI did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the test and the module it covers.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01MewfHa3JnUUtqZUu5w3QuH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016p44JSkwnXFKx9Mc1aEmw6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: the docstring says ROUND_HALF_EVEN, but the code uses ROUND_HALF_UP. I checked the test values by hand. 2.675 rounds to 2.68 under half-even because 7 is odd, and 2.665 rounds to 2.66 because 6 is even. So switching the constant fixes it. I'll create the branch and commit the change.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BzB9mf33PqVxs6jpi578Aa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01FixMm9utGK8eYaaqTjxtEi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money claimed banker's rounding but used ROUND_HALF_UP, causing\ntests/test_money.py to fail in the nightly build.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Next I'll start CI on the branch and wait for the result.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NdxZ8BsKoPxkxQxHhGZyDy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RknfHovuM1mYvmS3K58BHo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "CI passed. I'll open the pull request against main and request review from alex. I won't merge it, since merging into main needs code-owner approval.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01AgQ3QwBnMLroZE4EF4KWAJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` is documented as banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212), but the implementation used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This caused `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build.\n\nThis PR changes the rounding mode in `src/money.py` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. No other behavior changes.\n\n## Verification\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `08d3cd5986`: passed.\n- Test expectations checked by hand: 2.675 -> 2.68 and 2.665 -> 2.66 under half-even.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-half-even-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The nightly failure is fixed and PR #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **Root cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` had a docstring saying banker's rounding, but the code used `ROUND_HALF_UP`.\n- **Fix:** Changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on branch `fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding` (commit `08d3cd5986`). Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101, reviewer alex.\n\nI did not merge the PR. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner.", "type": "text"}]}]}